{"quest_id": 8152, "name": "眠った少女", "description": "雪の中で眠る少女を発見した王子たち。\nさらに魔力によって魔物たちが現れて！？\nワルツたちと協力して魔物を撃破せよ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "ビタースイートアイヴィワルツ", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920210, "map_no": 4838, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 10, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 218, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149776, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 37020, "global_id": 10637, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["置物", "ステルスII", "ブロック不可"], "fixture": true, "hp": 100000, "attack": 1, "base_hp": 100000, "base_attack": 1, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149792, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 2, "master_id": 37021, "global_id": 10638, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 70}]}, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 22, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 1300, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 1300, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 95, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098944, "special_effect_id": 39, "missile_id": 65, "missile": {"speed": 9.0}, "master_id": 131, "global_id": 130, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 8}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 59}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 4000, "attack": 240, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 240, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 98, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2115520, "special_effect_id": 308, "master_id": 31219, "global_id": 4838, "spawn_sec": 71}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2400, "attack": 650, "base_hp": 2400, "base_attack": 650, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2000, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2097472, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 24, "global_id": 23, "spawn_sec": 161}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["植物"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 900, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 900, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 280, "attack_speed": 100, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 211, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098960, "special_effect_id": 94, "master_id": 662, "global_id": 661, "spawn_sec": 174}], "popups": ["トレント(木型の魔物)系の敵は\n徐々に自身のHPを回復します。\n回復量は時間経過で\n減少していきます。", "マイコニドがいる間、\n全ての味方ユニットは\n継続ダメージを受けます。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 7, "lines": [{"name": "ワルツ", "text": "ほら皆、もう少しよ！\n寒中稽古のラストスパート、頑張りましょう！", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "うう～、身体はほかほか、空気はひえひえ。\n寒暖差で倒れそう……って、ほんとに誰か倒れてる？", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "ポミエ", "text": "というか、眠ってるみたいです！？\nお～い、風邪ひいちゃいますよ～？", "face": "u1422a1"}, {"name": "女の子", "text": "（すやすや）", "face": "l5a2c3e4e3084"}, {"name": "パレス", "text": "ま、待ってください！\nその子からなんだか、いや～な魔力が……。", "face": "u129"}, {"name": "フローガ", "text": "落ち着いてパレスちゃん、\nただの魔力の残滓だから。\nもっとも、相当ヤバい奴がいた証拠ですけど……。", "face": "u878"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "そういう魔力は、魔物たちを引き付けるから厄介だよね。\nほら、辺りを気配が囲ってる。", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "ポミエ", "text": "というか、向かってきてますよ～！？", "face": "u1422a1"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "どうやら、戦闘は避けられなさそうね。\n皆、気を引き締めていきましょう！", "face": "u2058a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ワルツ", "text": "――ふぅ。どうやら片付いたみたいね。\nどう？　女の子は目覚めた？", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "ポミエ", "text": "全然起きる気配がありません！\nキャロップちゃんの兎耳ビンタを受けているのに！", "face": "u1422a1"}, {"name": "キャロップ", "text": "ぺちぺちぺちぺちぺちぺちぺち。", "face": "u2059a1"}, {"name": "女の子", "text": "（すやすや）", "face": "l5a2c3e4e3084"}, {"name": "フローガ", "text": "強力かつ厄介な魔法を掛けられているようです。\nなのに、近付かないと魔力の乱れを感じ取れなかった。", "face": "u878"}, {"name": "ワルツ", "text": "つまり、コソコソやるのが上手いってことかしら？", "face": "u2058a1"}, {"name": "フローガ", "text": "犯人は強く、それ以上に繊細で狡猾な奴ですよ。\nそんな存在が、思うまま悪意を振りまいたとしたら――。", "face": "u878"}, {"name": "一般兵Ａ", "text": "――伝令ですッ！\n王都周辺にて、大勢の女性が次々と倒れたようです！\n全員が昏睡状態、被害は甚大な模様！", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうやら、事件のようですね。\nまずは被害状況の把握が先決です。\n急ぎ、城へと戻りましょう！", "face": "lcb4915c8653e"}]}], "active": true}